{"id":"32a5d2d48a46147b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Algebra Homomorphism","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Algebra Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Algebra Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Algebra Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3c066df70468180\" href=\"?note=c3c066df70468180\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md\">../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B,R\\in V\">\\(f,A,B,R\\in V\\)</span> (candidate map, algebra carriers, and common scalar-ring carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> (structured algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3c066df70468180\" href=\"?note=c3c066df70468180\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> (structured unital ring-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md\">../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S(f,A,B,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A,\\eta_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_B)\\land \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B)\\land \\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(\\eta_A(r))=\\eta_B(r)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S(f,A,B,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A,\\eta_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_B)\\land \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B)\\land \\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(\\eta_A(r))=\\eta_B(r)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final conjunct expresses compatibility with the two structure maps from the same scalar ring; without it, a ring homomorphism need not be an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-algebra homomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3c066df70468180","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3c066df70468180","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ (structured algebra predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-alg-algebra-over-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ (structured unital ring-homomorphism predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,A,B,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2AlgebraHomomorphism}_S(f,A,B,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A,\\eta_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_A)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta_B)\\land \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,B,+_B,\\cdot_B,0_B,1_B)\\land \\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(\\eta_A(r))=\\eta_B(r)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1686,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1417","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-algebra-homomorphism]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c3c066df70468180","28f002080d71355a"]}